{"timestamp": 1779395348.049401, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 10, "data": {"caller": "player_4", "reason": "Eve reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Alice"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779395348.050269, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 10, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779395354.868178, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I found Alice\u2019s body in Electrical, right on/near the task area. My route was Storage -> Medbay -> Electrical. I didn\u2019t see any living players in the rooms I was in, and no one was with me when I found the body. The only movement I noticed was Frank leaving Medbay toward Upper Engine around T7. I don\u2019t have an accusation yet, just reporting location and route."}}
{"timestamp": 1779395366.234658, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Bob here. My route was Upper Engine -> Oxygen -> back to Upper Engine. I didn\u2019t see Alice at all and I never went near Electrical this round.\n\nI saw Frank enter Upper Engine from the Medbay side at around T9. That lines up with Eve saying she saw Frank leaving Medbay toward Upper Engine earlier. Since the body was in Electrical and Medbay is connected right next to it, Frank is the only person I can place near that side of the map, but I don\u2019t have proof he came from Electrical specifically.\n\nI\u2019d like to hear Frank\u2019s full route and whether anyone can vouch for him."}}
{"timestamp": 1779395382.013136, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route was Navigation -> Security -> Weapons. I didn\u2019t see Alice at all.\n\nImportant thing: at around T6 I saw Charlie enter Security from the Electrical side. Since Alice\u2019s body was found in Electrical, Charlie definitely needs to explain what he saw/did there and whether Alice was alive when he left. I ended up in Weapons with Charlie when the meeting got called.\n\nSo right now the people I think we need to hear from most are Charlie, because he came directly from Electrical, and Frank, because Eve/Bob place him around Medbay/Upper Engine near that area too."}}
{"timestamp": 1779395399.512684, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started in Electrical. Frank was already/also there with me around T2-T4, and Alice entered Electrical from Cafeteria at about T3. I saw Alice alive in Electrical at T3/T4, and Frank was there at the same time.\n\nI left Electrical toward Security and got there around T6. Diana came into Security from Navigation at T6, then we ended up in Weapons together when the meeting was called. So Diana can confirm I came into Security, but from my side: Alice was alive when I last saw her in Electrical.\n\nThe important part is that Frank was in Electrical with Alice right before I left, and then Eve/Bob both place Frank moving through Medbay/Upper Engine afterward. Since the body was found in Electrical, that route makes sense for someone leaving the kill area. I\u2019m not 100% saying it\u2019s Frank without hearing him, but Frank is definitely the person I\u2019m most suspicious of right now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779395424.48209, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Whoa, hold on. Charlie is completely twisting the timeline to save himself. \n\nHere is my actual route: Medbay -> Electrical -> Medbay -> Upper Engine -> Oxygen. \n\nI *was* in Electrical early on, and yes, Alice came in around T3. But I left Electrical around T4 to head back to Medbay for my tasks. When I walked out of Electrical, **Charlie and Alice were still in there together alive**. \n\nEve, you saw me in Medbay around T7, which perfectly matches my timeline of leaving Electrical early and doing my Medbay task. Bob, you saw me in Upper Engine at T9, which again perfectly matches my route moving away from the area.\n\nDiana, you said Charlie walked into Security at T6. The walk from Electrical to Security is quick. If I left at T4, that gave Charlie the perfect window to kill Alice while they were alone, and then walk into Security at T6 to build an alibi with you. \n\nCharlie knows I was the only other person in Electrical, so he's trying to preemptively frame me before I could point out that he was left alone with her. I'm voting Charlie, this is a clear self-report/frame job."}}
{"timestamp": 1779395445.49715, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "From my side, I can only hard-confirm two things: I found Alice dead in Electrical, and I saw Frank leaving Medbay toward Upper Engine around T7. I did **not** see Charlie myself.\n\nThe stories conflict on the key point: who was left alone with Alice in Electrical. Charlie says Frank was there with Alice when he left; Frank says Charlie was there with Alice when Frank left. Since Diana confirms Charlie came from the Electrical side into Security around T6, Charlie definitely had the timing to leave Electrical after the kill.\n\nFrank\u2019s route also matches what I saw at T7, so I\u2019m leaning more suspicious of Charlie right now, but it\u2019s basically between Charlie and Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779395469.96836, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I\u2019ll just add to what I said earlier: the only thing I personally saw was Frank entering Upper Engine from the Medbay side at T9. That matches Eve seeing him leave Medbay toward Upper Engine around T7, so Frank\u2019s movement after Electrical is at least consistent with what two of us saw.\n\nThat doesn\u2019t fully clear Frank, because he still admits he was in Electrical with Alice early. But Charlie is also confirmed by Diana coming from the Electrical side into Security around T6, and that timing is exactly the window where Alice could have died.\n\nSo for me it comes down to who was last alone with Alice. Charlie says Frank was; Frank says Charlie was. The outside info we have makes Frank\u2019s route line up pretty cleanly, while Charlie\u2019s confirmed movement is directly out of the body location shortly after. I\u2019m leaning Charlie unless someone has a stronger reason not to."}}
{"timestamp": 1779395489.423615, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I can confirm my part: I came Navigation -> Security, and at about T6 Charlie entered Security from the Electrical side. After that we went/ended up in Weapons together, so I can vouch for Charlie only **after** he reached Security, not before.\n\nThe big issue is the Electrical timeline. Charlie and Frank both admit Alice was in Electrical with them early, but they disagree on who left Alice alone. From outside witnesses, Frank\u2019s later route is backed up by Eve seeing him around Medbay and Bob seeing him in Upper Engine. Charlie\u2019s movement is also confirmed by me, but it\u2019s specifically him coming **out of the Electrical side** shortly after Alice must have died.\n\nSo based on what we have, I\u2019m leaning Charlie over Frank. Not 100%, but Charlie had the cleanest window to kill Alice and then come into Security at T6."}}
{"timestamp": 1779395511.747751, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "The timing actually supports my route too: Electrical to Security takes about 2 ticks, and Diana saw me arrive Security at T6, which means I left Electrical around T4. That matches exactly what I said.\n\nAt T4 I saw both Alice and Frank still in Electrical. I left toward Security. Frank then says he went Electrical -> Medbay, and Eve sees him coming out of Medbay around T7, which is also perfectly consistent with him killing in Electrical around T4/T5, moving to Medbay, then leaving.\n\nSo Frank\u2019s \u201cconfirmed route\u201d after the fact does not clear him \u2014 it places him on the escape path from Electrical. I know this looks like a 50/50, but from my POV Frank is the only one who could\u2019ve killed Alice after I left. If we vote wrong here we lose a goose, so please think about the travel timing: I was already on the way to Security by the time Alice died. My vote is Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779395527.339067, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Charlie, your own timeline traps you. You admit you left Electrical around T4, and Diana saw you in Security at T6. That 2-tick window is exactly when Alice died. The only difference between our stories is who walked out first, but look at the aftermath: my route through Medbay and Upper Engine is fully corroborated by Eve and Bob at multiple timestamps (T7 and T9). You killed her at T4/T5, then immediately walked into Security to buddy up with Diana for an alibi. \n\nEve, Bob, Diana \u2014 thank you for looking at the timeline objectively. My movements are verified across the entire left side of the map by two separate witnesses. Charlie is backed into a corner and pushing this 50/50 because he has no other option. \n\nI'm locking my vote on Charlie. If by some miracle I'm wrong, you can vote me next round, but this is a clear-cut case. Let's get him out.\n\nCharlie"}}
